				</li>

				<li>
					<h3 class="text-[clamp(19px,1.6vw,23px)] leading-snug font-semibold text-paper">
						<a
							href="https://www.cloudquery.io/events/cloud-governance-security"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class={LINK}
						>
							Cloud Governance & Security Webinar
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">CloudQuery · December 19th, 2024 (virtual)</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">
						Managing governance, security, and regulatory compliance across multi-cloud environments
						with security monitoring and automated remediation workflows.
					</p>
				</li>

				<li>
					<h3 class="text-[clamp(19px,1.6vw,23px)] leading-snug font-semibold text-paper">
						<a
							href="https://www.cloudquery.io/events/improve-aws-visibility"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class={LINK}
						>
							Improve AWS Visibility & Governance Webinar
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">CloudQuery · December 19th, 2024 (virtual)</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">
						Getting complete visibility into AWS infrastructure across all regions and accounts,
						with resource tracking, optimization, and SQL-based querying.
					</p>
				</li>

				<li>
					<h3 class="text-[clamp(19px,1.6vw,23px)] leading-snug font-semibold text-paper">
