					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Tinybird Live Coding · January 9th, 2024 (virtual)</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">
						Live coding session on building real-time data products using Kafka. Co-hosted with Jim
						Moffitt.
					</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<!-- 2023 -->
		<section
			class="mb-14 grid scroll-mt-24 gap-x-10 gap-y-2 border-t border-surface-4 pt-5 md:grid-cols-[clamp(140px,16vw,240px)_1fr]"
			id="2023"
		>
			<h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(64px,9vw,140px)] leading-[0.85] font-normal text-pink md:sticky md:top-24 md:self-start">
				2023
			</h2>
			<ul class="space-y-7">
				<li>
					<h3 class="text-[clamp(19px,1.6vw,23px)] leading-snug font-semibold text-paper">
						From Kafka to APIs in Minutes
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">
						Tinybird Live Coding · November 14th, 2023 (virtual)
					</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">
						Live coding session demonstrating rapid API development from Kafka streams. Co-hosted
