						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Tinybird Live Coding · May 17th, 2023 (virtual)</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">
						Building a miniature version of Datadog's infrastructure monitoring tool - using Kafka
						to stream events and Tinybird's native Kafka connector for ingestion.
					</p>
				</li>

				<li>
					<h3 class="text-[clamp(19px,1.6vw,23px)] leading-snug font-semibold text-paper">
						Launch Week #2 Release Round-up
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Tinybird Live Coding · April 21st, 2023 (virtual)</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">
						Recap of Tinybird's Launch Week #2 releases and new features. Co-hosted with Alasdair
						Brown.
					</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<!-- 2022 -->
		<section
			class="mb-14 grid scroll-mt-24 gap-x-10 gap-y-2 border-t border-surface-4 pt-5 md:grid-cols-[clamp(140px,16vw,240px)_1fr]"
			id="2022"
		>
			<h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(64px,9vw,140px)] leading-[0.85] font-normal text-pink md:sticky md:top-24 md:self-start">
				2022
			</h2>
			<ul class="space-y-7">
				<li>
					<h3 class="text-[clamp(19px,1.6vw,23px)] leading-snug font-semibold text-paper">
						DoK Talks #120: A Gentle Introduction to Building Data Intensive Applications
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">CNCF Data on Kubernetes · March 2022 (virtual)</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">
						Gotchas and best practices for building, deploying, and scaling data-intensive apps -
						building a key-value store from scratch using only SQL. Co-presented with Bart Farrell.
					</p>
				</li>

				<li>
					<h3 class="text-[clamp(19px,1.6vw,23px)] leading-snug font-semibold text-paper">
