					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Live Coders Conf · June 6th, 2020 (virtual)</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">IoT kitty litter box talk at the Live Coders Conference.</p>
				</li>

				<li>
					<h3 class="text-[clamp(19px,1.6vw,23px)] leading-snug font-semibold text-paper">
						From SQL to NoSQL: A Gentle Introduction For JS Developers
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Node.js Global Summit · May 30th, 2020</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-muted">
						Changing your mindset from tabular data modeling to NoSQL -- comparing SQL and MongoDB
